            "value" : "“%@” downloads as soon as you are on Wi-Fi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ohne Verbindung spielt nur, was auf diesem iPhone ist. Über „…“ → „Im WLAN herunterladen“ merkt sich die App den Titel." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without a connection only what is on this iPhone plays. Use “…” → “Download on Wi-Fi” and the app remembers the title."
